# Keep secrets and local state out of the BFF image.
# Without this file the Dockerfile's `COPY . /app` bakes .env — including the
# MinIO keys and the OIDC client secret — into every layer of the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
*.md